---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Golden Glow Nail Studio"
  description="Meet Golden Glow Nail Studio in Staten Island — a neighborhood nail salon focused on artistry, comfort, and clean, precise work."
>
  <section class="page-header container">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
    <h1>A neighborhood salon built around craft.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Golden Glow Nail Studio is a full-service nail salon on Greaves Lane, serving Great Kills and greater
      Staten Island. We believe your nails should feel as good as they look — and that a great manicure is
      equal parts artistry, hygiene, and time well spent.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="about container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>
          Golden Glow was founded to bring high-end nail art and spa-quality service to our home
          neighborhood. What started with a small team of nail artists has grown into a studio known
          for clean lines, comfortable service, and designs that get noticed.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Our Craft</h2>
        <p>
          From classic French manicures to intricate hand-painted art and 3D nail sculptures, our
          artists work across a wide range of techniques — gel, acrylic, dip, and more. Bring us
          your inspiration; we&rsquo;ll bring it to life.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Clean &amp; Careful</h2>
        <p>
          Sanitation isn&rsquo;t optional. We use fresh files and buffers for every guest, hospital-grade
          disinfection for tools, and a clean, well-ventilated studio so you can relax without a second
          thought.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Come As You Are</h2>
        <p>
          Walk-ins are always welcome. Book ahead if you&rsquo;d like a specific artist or a longer
          design session — a quick call is all it takes.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band container">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Ready to book?</h2>
        <p>Give us a call — we&rsquo;ll find a time that works for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="tel:+17189847777" class="btn primary">Call (718) 984-7777</a>
        <a href="/gallery" class="btn secondary">See Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #21A69A;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    max-width: 720px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #4a5b64;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(9, 60, 79, 0.08);
  }

  .about-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: #093C4F;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .about-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #4a5b64;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .cta-band {
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(33, 166, 154, 0.12), rgba(246, 198, 90, 0.15));
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-inner h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .cta-inner p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #4a5b64;
  }

  .cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
